Shoddy itself - the mill, the machines, the VS Code extension and sparky -
has no PDF component and no dependency on one, direct or transitive. What
those do contain (Roslyn, Silk.NET, OpenAL Soft, GLFW) is listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which travels inside the extension.

The Fettler binaries - fettle and burler - and the third-party software
they bundle are no longer distributed from this repository. Fettler is its
own project now and ships with its own notices:
https://shoddymills.github.io/shoddy-fettler/
